00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:06.550
[Erin] Sorry, what?

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.328
Upshot takes the notes for you.

00:00:08.457 --> 00:00:09.686
No bot in the room.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.808
Click any word to hear that moment.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:15.300
[Call recording] Our launch date is November 14th.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.530
Plug it into anything with webhooks, a CLI and an MCP server.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.454
Free on Mac, Windows and Linux.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.500
