00:00:28.675 --> 00:00:32.668
social posts from your podcasts and webinars, one-click actions,

00:00:32.762 --> 00:00:36.081
action items across meetings, and notes in your Obsidian vault.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.605
Imagine every meeting where you're fully present, and nothing slips through.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.050
Every decision. Every action item.

00:00:43.055 --> 00:00:45.237
Every word, right there when you need it.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.329
Upshot. Never miss a word.

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:51.968
Download it free at upshotnotes.com.
